    "collapsible_content_VamDgi": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_h7KgCT": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is there a minimum follower count for affiliate partners?",
            "answer": "<p>No. We care about authentic fit, not follower count. A BJJ coach with 2,000 highly engaged followers in the right community is worth more to us than 50,000 generic fitness followers. Apply and tell us about your audience — we'll evaluate fit honestly.</p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_4Dzctz": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the minimum wholesale order?",
            "answer": "<p>Opening orders start at 24 units minimum — mix and match products. Reorders can be smaller once an account is established. We'll discuss specific terms during the application process based on your location and expected volume.</p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_Pgqdgw": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does affiliate tracking and payment work?",
            "answer": "<p>You'll receive a unique tracking link and a personal discount code from day one. Commission tiers are calculated on your total monthly referred sales — 15% up to $499, 20% from $500–$1,999, and 25% at $2,000 and above. Tiers reset monthly. You'll have access to a real-time dashboard showing clicks, conversions, and earnings. We pay monthly via direct bank transfer or PayPal with no minimum payout threshold.<br/><br/></p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_cnkajx": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does athlete sponsorship work at this stage?",
            "answer": "<p>We're honest about where we are as a brand. Right now sponsorship means product supply every month — the full PHASIS stack — plus a 20% affiliate commission that scales to 25% on top of that. No cash deals yet, but that changes as the brand grows and we'll reward the athletes who were with us early. What we ask for in return is authentic representation — use the product, post about it honestly, tag us at competitions. No scripts, no forced content. If you're someone who'd use this anyway, it's a natural fit.</p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_GUYxqX": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does Brand Collaboration work?",
            "answer": "<p>Brand Collaboration isn't an open program — we take on a small number of partnerships each year with gyms, academies, and organizations that are a genuine fit for what PHASIS is building. If you think that's you, tell us who your community is, what you do, and why PHASIS belongs in it. We'll take it from there.</p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_zyhAJG": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I stock only one product or do I need to carry all three?",
            "answer": "<p>You can start with any single product. Many wholesale partners begin with Max Relief because it's the most universal — it works for everyone in pain regardless of training background. We don't require you to carry the full line, though most partners do once they see the sell-through rates.</p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        }
      },
